    <string key="page.alt">Driving through Riyadh</string>
    <string key="page.blurb">From Masmak Fort in the old town up King Fahd Road past Al Faisaliah and Kingdom Centre, then west to Diriyah and back. Saher cameras see everything.</string>
    <string key="page.T_MAPNOTE">The road roughly follows real places in Riyadh. The horn makes the car ahead move over.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R1S">Pick a trip between Riyadh landmarks, from Masmak to Kingdom Centre to Diriyah, and reach the end.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R3S">Saher cameras flash above 120 km/h, and crashes damage the car.</string>
